</details></section></div><div class="order-7 w-full min-w-0 md:order-none"><section class="reveal w-full min-w-0 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white"><details open="" class="group"><summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 pt-6 pb-6 group-open:pb-4 sm:px-8 sm:pt-8 md:cursor-default [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><h2 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-xl">Langues</h2><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-700 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 md:hidden"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.51 5.99c-.64-.64.34-1.62.98-.98l6.5 6.5c.26.27.26.71 0 .98l-6.5 6.5c-.64.64-1.62-.34-.98-.98L14.53 12Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4 px-6 pb-6 sm:px-8 sm:pb-8"><ul class="flex flex-col gap-3"><li class="break-words text-gray-700 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">→ </span>Français</li><li class="break-words text-gray-700 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">→ </span>Anglais</li><li class="break-words text-gray-700 text-sm"><span aria-hidden="true">→ </span>Italien</li></ul></div></details></section></div><div class="order-8 w-full min-w-0 md:order-none"><section class="reveal w-full min-w-0 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white"><details open="" class="group"><summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 pt-6 pb-6 group-open:pb-4 sm:px-8 sm:pt-8 md:cursor-default [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><h2 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-xl">Formations &amp; diplômes</h2><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-700 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 md:hidden"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.51 5.99c-.64-.64.34-1.62.98-.98l6.5 6.5c.26.27.26.71 0 .98l-6.5 6.5c-.64.64-1.62-.34-.98-.98L14.53 12Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4 px-6 pb-6 sm:px-8 sm:pb-8"><ul class="flex flex-col gap-5"><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="break-words font-semibold text-gray-700">CAP Esthétique, cosmétique, parfumerie</p><p class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-4 text-gray-600 text-sm italic"><span class="break-words">École fictive des métiers de la beauté</span><span>juin 2014</span></p><p class="break-words text-gray-500 text-sm italic">Formation générale, avec un module de maquillage de jour et de soirée.</p></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="break-words font-semibold text-gray-700">Certificat de maquillage professionnel</p><p class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-4 text-gray-600 text-sm italic"><span class="break-words">Atelier fictif du maquillage</span><span>novembre 2015</span></p></li></ul></div></details></section></div></div><div class="contents md:col-span-8 md:flex md:min-w-0 md:flex-col md:items-start md:gap-5"><div class="order-4 w-full min-w-0 md:order-none"><section class="reveal w-full min-w-0 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-xl">À propos</h2><p class="break-words text-gray-800">Maquilleuse professionnelle installée à Annecy depuis dix ans, je prépare les mariées du lac et des montagnes alentour. Je viens chez vous le jour J, avec un maquillage pensé pour tenir de la cérémonie jusqu’à la fin de la soirée, en photo comme à l’œil nu.</p></div></section></div><div class="order-3 w-full min-w-0 md:order-none"><section class="reveal w-full min-w-0 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-xl">Portfolio</h2><section aria-roledescription="carrousel" aria-label="Portfolio d’Inès Morel" class="flex w-full min-w-0 fl