 class="break-words text-start font-bold text-indigo-900 text-lg">Maquillage de la mariée</h3><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-gray-300 border-l pl-4"><p class="break-words text-gray-700">Le jour J, chez vous ou sur le lieu de la cérémonie, retouches comprises.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2"><p class="max-w-full whitespace-pre-line break-words text-right font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-lg">À partir de 180 €</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><details class="group border-gray-300 border-t py-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-gray-700 group-open:text-indigo-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><span class="min-w-0 break-words">Retouches jusqu’au dîner</span><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.51 5.99c-.64-.64.34-1.62.98-.98l6.5 6.5c.26.27.26.71 0 .98l-6.5 6.5c-.64.64-1.62-.34-.98-.98L14.53 12Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="pt-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-gray-300 border-l pl-4"><p class="break-words text-gray-700">Je reste jusqu’au repas.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2"><p class="max-w-full whitespace-pre-line break-words text-right font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-lg">60 €</p></div></div></div></details></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="break-words text-start font-bold text-indigo-900 text-lg">Essai maquillage</h3><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-gray-300 border-l pl-4"><p class="break-words text-gray-700">Une séance pour choisir ensemble le maquillage du jour J.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2"><p class="max-w-full whitespace-pre-line break-words text-right font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-lg">60 €</p></div></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="break-words text-start font-bold text-indigo-900 text-lg">Maquillage des invitées</h3><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-gray-300 border-l pl-4"><p class="break-words text-gray-700">Pour la famille et les témoins, le matin du mariage.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2"><p class="max-w-full whitespace-pre-line break-words text-right font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-lg">À partir de 45 €</p></div></div></li></ul></div></section></div><div class="order-9 w-full min-w-0 md:order-none"><section class="reveal w-full min-w-0 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white"><details open="" class="group"><summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 pt-6 pb-6 group-open:pb-4 sm:px-8 sm:pt-8 md:cursor-default [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><h2 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-xl">Expériences professionnelles</h2><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-700 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 md:hidden"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.51 5.99c-.64-.64.34-1.62.98-.98l6.5 6.5c.26.27.26.71 0 .98l-6.5 6.5c-.64.64-1.62-.34-.98-.98L14.53 12Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4 px-6 pb-6 sm:px-8 sm:pb-8"><ul class="flex flex-col gap-5"><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="break-words font-semibold text-gray-700">Institut fictif du Lac</p><p class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-4 text-gray-600 text-sm italic"><span class="break-words">Esthéticienne maquilleuse</span><span>septembre 2015 - août 2018</span></p><p class="break-words text-gray-600 text-sm italic">à Annecy</p><p class="break-words text-gray-500 text-sm italic">Soins, maquillage de jour et préparation des mariées.</p></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="break-words font-semibold text-gray-700">Inès Morel Maquillage</p><p class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-4 text-gray-600 text-sm italic"><span class="break-words">Maquilleuse indépendante</span><span>septembre 2018 - aujourd’hui</span></p><p class="break-words text-gray-600 text-sm italic">à Annecy</p></li></ul></div></details></section></div></div></div></div><div class="sticky bottom-0 z-20 flex items-center gap-4 border-gray-300 border-t bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-[0_-4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] md:hidden justify-between"><p class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-gray-800">À partir de 45 €</p><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" class="inline-flex min-h-12 max-w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-700 px-6 py-2 text-center [overflow-wrap:anywhere] font-semibold text-base text-white hover:bg-indigo-800 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 min-w-0">Contacter Inès</button></div></main>